data: {"id": "3eadaf0c0e1248fc-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3eadaf0c0e1248fc", "seq": 788, "ts_ms": 1789374012617, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.25, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1671, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'aiops-case-v14/workload' stuck in 'ContainerCreating' (Pending) phase due to sandbox creation failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 证明 Multus 在节点 CNI 目录中找不到名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的插件二进制文件 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Annotations: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 确认 Pod 请求使用名为 `secondary-net` 的二次网络 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating`, `Pod.status: Pending` | 记录 Pod 停滞在沙箱创建阶段的当前状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立监控数据确认容器处于等待创建状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件（事实 #1）直接指出了失败的物理机制：Multus CNI 调用链在 `/opt/cni/bin` 下查找 `aiops-unavailable` 插件失败。配置事实（事实 #2）展示了触发该机制的根源（对 `secondary-net` 的引用）。Metric 数据（事实 #4）从监控维度交叉验证了 Pod 确实卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点缺少 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' → Secondary network 'secondary-net' 绑定引用该缺失插件 → Kubelet 执行 sandbox 创建时 Multus 配置网络失败 → Pod 状态停滞在 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending'\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** 节点上的 CNI 插件二进制文件 `aiops-unavailable` 缺失。\n\n**证据支持：**\n- 节点日志明确报错 `failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`（事实 #1）。\n- Pod 配置声明使用了依赖该插件的网络 `secondary-net`（事实 #2）。\n- 缺失该二进制文件导致 Multus 无法完成网络附加，进而导致 Pod 沙箱创建失败，无法进入 `Running` 阶段（事实 #3）。\n\n现有证据链完整，直接解释了 Pod 停滞现象。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'aiops-case-v14/workload' stuck in 'ContainerCreating' (Pending) phase due to sandbox creation failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 证明 Multus 在节点 CNI 目录中找不到名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的插件二进制文件 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Annotations: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 确认 Pod 请求使用名为 `secondary-net` 的二次网络 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating`, `Pod.status: Pending` | 记录 Pod 停滞在沙箱创建阶段的当前状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立监控数据确认容器处于等待创建状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件（事实 #1）直接指出了失败的物理机制：Multus CNI 调用链在 `/opt/cni/bin` 下查找 `aiops-unavailable` 插件失败。配置事实（事实 #2）展示了触发该机制的根源（对 `secondary-net` 的引用）。Metric 数据（事实 #4）从监控维度交叉验证了 Pod 确实卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点缺少 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' → Secondary network 'secondary-net' 绑定引用该缺失插件 → Kubelet 执行 sandbox 创建时 Multus 配置网络失败 → Pod 状态停滞在 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending'\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** 节点上的 CNI 插件二进制文件 `aiops-unavailable` 缺失。\n\n**证据支持：**\n- 节点日志明确报错 `failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`（事实 #1）。\n- Pod 配置声明使用了依赖该插件的网络 `secondary-net`（事实 #2）。\n- 缺失该二进制文件导致 Multus 无法完成网络附加，进而导致 Pod 沙箱创建失败，无法进入 `Running` 阶段（事实 #3）。\n\n现有证据链完整，直接解释了 Pod 停滞现象。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "3eadaf0c0e1248fc-final", "run_id": "3eadaf0c0e1248fc", "seq": 790, "ts_ms": 1789374012628, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'aiops-case-v14/workload' stuck in 'ContainerCreating' (Pending) phase due to sandbox creation failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 证明 Multus 在节点 CNI 目录中找不到名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的插件二进制文件 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Annotations: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 确认 Pod 请求使用名为 `secondary-net` 的二次网络 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating`, `Pod.status: Pending` | 记录 Pod 停滞在沙箱创建阶段的当前状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立监控数据确认容器处于等待创建状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件（事实 #1）直接指出了失败的物理机制：Multus CNI 调用链在 `/opt/cni/bin` 下查找 `aiops-unavailable` 插件失败。配置事实（事实 #2）展示了触发该机制的根源（对 `secondary-net` 的引用）。Metric 数据（事实 #4）从监控维度交叉验证了 Pod 确实卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点缺少 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' → Secondary network 'secondary-net' 绑定引用该缺失插件 → Kubelet 执行 sandbox 创建时 Multus 配置网络失败 → Pod 状态停滞在 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending'\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** 节点上的 CNI 插件二进制文件 `aiops-unavailable` 缺失。\n\n**证据支持：**\n- 节点日志明确报错 `failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`（事实 #1）。\n- Pod 配置声明使用了依赖该插件的网络 `secondary-net`（事实 #2）。\n- 缺失该二进制文件导致 Multus 无法完成网络附加，进而导致 Pod 沙箱创建失败，无法进入 `Running` 阶段（事实 #3）。\n\n现有证据链完整，直接解释了 Pod 停滞现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 38.3s (Evidence 28.1s, RCA 10.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.424, "metrics": {"run_id": "3eadaf0c0e1248fc", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.43633794784546, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 61436.33794784546, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 57940.924644470215, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8885.530948638916, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3057.321310043335}, "nodes": {"layer": 